# The schema author's trap: "a ledger id is an integer", spelled
# `integer`. A 0d-rescued 64-bit id has biginteger kind, the numeric
# leaves are disjoint, and this schema refuses the very records the
# 0d escape exists to save. check.sh vets data/customer-bigid.aon
# against this and asserts the refusal.
customers: { &: { ledgerId:integer & min(1) } }
